* QM2 only: the receiving end of QM1's payments.
DEFINE CHANNEL('QM1.TO.QM2') CHLTYPE(RCVR) TRPTYPE(TCP) MCAUSER('app') REPLACE
SET CHLAUTH('QM1.TO.QM2') TYPE(QMGRMAP) QMNAME('QM1') USERSRC(CHANNEL) DESCR('Lab: QM1 sends payments') ACTION(REPLACE)
SET CHLAUTH('QM1.TO.QM2') TYPE(ADDRESSMAP) ADDRESS('*') USERSRC(CHANNEL) DESCR('Lab: QM1 sends payments') ACTION(REPLACE)
* The receiver puts with the sender's message context, which needs set-all-context authority.
SET AUTHREC OBJTYPE(QMGR) PRINCIPAL('app') AUTHADD(SETALL)
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('PAYMENT.**') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(SETALL)
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('SYSTEM.DEAD.LETTER.QUEUE') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(SETALL)
